{
  ""thought"": ""To solve this problem, I need to set up an equation based on the information given. Let's denote the number of pens as P and the number of pencils as C. According to the problem, Issac buys 108 writing utensils in total, which means P + C = 108. Additionally, he buys 12 more than 5 times the number of pencils than pens, which translates to C = 5P + 12. I will use these two equations to solve for P."",
